# Package com.orange.ouds.theme.whitelabel

This package contains the user-facing customization classes:
- `WhiteLabelTheme` - The main theme class that extends WireframeTheme
- `WhiteLabelFontFamily` - Functional interface for customizing fonts
- `WhiteLabelColorScheme` - Customizable color scheme with fallback to Wireframe colors
- `WhiteLabelMaterialColorScheme` - Customizable Material 3 color scheme
- `WhiteLabelBorders` - Customizable border properties (radius, width, style)

# Package com.orange.ouds.theme.whitelabel.tokens.material

This package provides internal Material color token implementations (`WhiteLabelMaterialColorTokens`) generated from `WhiteLabelMaterialColorScheme` with fallback to Wireframe values.

This class is an internal implementation detail. Users should interact with `WhiteLabelMaterialColorScheme` in the `com.orange.ouds.theme.whitelabel` package instead.

# Package com.orange.ouds.theme.whitelabel.tokens.semantic

This package provides internal semantic token implementations that bridge the user-facing customization classes to the OUDS token system:
- **Color tokens** (e.g., `WhiteLabelColorSemanticTokens`, `WhiteLabelColorActionSemanticTokens`) - Generated from `WhiteLabelColorScheme` with fallback to Wireframe values
- **Border tokens** (`WhiteLabelBorderSemanticTokens`) - Generated from `WhiteLabelBorders` with fallback to Wireframe values

These classes are internal implementation details. Users should interact with the user-facing classes in the `com.orange.ouds.theme.whitelabel` package instead.